OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe cloud and patchy light rain in the
OL,7,Fsouth tonight, this steadily easing
OL,8,Fwith temperatures near normal. Further
OL,9,Fnorth, clear skies developing and
OL,10,Ftemperatures dropping with widespread
OL,11,Ffrost. Winds stay light for most, but
OL,12,Fbreezier over hills.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FAny lingering rain and cloud
OL,15,Fclears on Friday morning, with a dry
OL,16,Fday and plenty of sunshine following.
OL,17,FDaytime temperatures near average, but
OL,18,Fa colder night ahead with widespread
OL,19,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
