OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAfter
OL,6,Fa frosty start, Saturday remains dry
OL,7,Fwith more autumnal sunshine. It turns
OL,8,Fwindier and cloudier on Sunday, with
OL,9,Frain arriving on Monday evening.
OL,10,FOvernight, chilly with patchy frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
